      "verbatim_texts": [
        "To start, you need to note the vendor number on the Invoice entry form."
      ],
      "justification": "Covers the process initiation and the first required step. Redundant phrasing across action:i1 and action:n2 preserves the exact behaviour."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n3",
        "guard:b1->n4",
        "action:n4"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If you choose to \"Sort Invoice by vendor\", you should proceed with the process."
      ],
      "justification": "Models the decision point and the positive branch for sorting by vendor. The guard abstracts the choice variable without changing logic."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b1->n5",
        "action:n5"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "However, if you decide to \"Sort invoice by invoice amount\", you should also continue with the process."
      ],
      "justification": "Captures the alternative branch for sorting by amount and correctly rejoins the flow after the optional sort step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n8"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "It takes approximately 20 minutes for every 100 invoices"
      ],
      "justification": "Directly represents the time-estimation step mentioned in the source."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n13",
        "action:n9"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "and once you have entered the invoice data, make sure to tick \"invoice entered\" on the invoice entry form."
      ],
      "justification": "Split into two sequential actions that faithfully preserve the required order and meaning of the original sentence."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n10",
        "action:n11"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Once you have placed the invoice batch in the Urgent Outbox, it will be collected every hour."
      ],
      "justification": "Corresponds directly to placing the batch and initiating the recurring hourly collection cycle."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n12"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "The collection process will continue every hour until the end of the overall process."
      ],
      "justification": "Maps to the termination condition of the workflow, correctly marking the process end."
    }
  ],
